# Vercel CLI deploys (`vercel deploy`) upload the local working directory and
# do not fully honor .gitignore for dotfiles — local env files were observed
# leaking into a build (local DATABASE_URL used instead of the Production
# value). Exclude them explicitly. Production env vars always come from
# `vercel env add` / the Vercel dashboard, never from these local files.
.env
.env.local
.env.production.local
.env.production.notes
agendai_social.db
